Phones and Laptops have the highest average ratings among all product categories, indicating that customers are generally more satisfied with these products than with other categories.

Gaming and Headphones have comparatively lower ratings, suggesting these categories may require improvements in product quality, pricing, or customer experience.

There is no strong correlation between List Price and Discount Percentage, as products across different price ranges receive varying discounts. This indicates that discounts are not based solely on product price.

Review Count varies significantly across products, with a few products receiving a very large number of reviews. This suggests that some products are much more popular and attract higher customer engagement than others.

